# Yuzhnoye, Republic of Ingushetia

}}
Yuzhnoye () is a rural locality (a selo) in Malgobeksky District, Republic of Ingushetia, Russia. Population:
Geography
This rural locality is located  from Malgobek (the district's administrative centre),  from Magas (capital of Republic of Ingushetia) and  from Moscow. Voznesenskaya is the nearest rural locality.
